{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的音乐细节和情绪变化提示明显少于 X，尤其缺少按音乐具体时点展开的细微层次，部分感受显得概括。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的左右分栏让叙事和音乐感受各有位置，左侧用完整句子交代前因后果，右侧可以快速扫读，人物为什么反复、为什么犹豫、最后如何调整自己，都比较容易跟上。X 的关键词加亮和按音乐时点出现的提示更有利于捕捉局部重点，感受也更细腻具体，但信息切分较多，容易让注意力在大量细节之间跳转。作为边听边看的普通观众，我更容易通过 Y 把整段故事连起来，但会觉得 X 对音乐本身的描写更丰富。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "94ba3d49-1e41-4959-ac1a-7d97397cff5e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T163315098469Z", "elapsed_seconds": 114.313, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:35:09.416782+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "eb3542e8ccd4cce46e4b4b4df884030368c45df8a89b9476a81d4738dc041ec9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_